ctive test ownership. Drives innovation in testing strategies, processes, and automation adoption. Adapts effectively to changing requirements and testing priorities. Maintains attention to detail in testing, validation, and defect management. Takes initiative in improving test coverage, processes, and quality practices. \n\n Mandatory Competencies \n QA/QE - QA Automation - Junit QA/QE - QA Automation - BDD / Cucumber QA/QE - QA Automation - Ready API QA/QE - QA Automation - Robot QA/QE - QA Automation - Python QA/QE - QA Automation - Core Java QA/QE - QA Automation - Xpath QA/QE - QA Automation - Web Analytics Testing QA - Risk Management QA/QE - QA Automation - Framework creation for testing QA/QE - QA Automation - Basic Build, Deployment and CI/CD Beh - Communication and collaboration\n\nKey Skills: api automation,bdd,business automation,it services,cucumber,financial services,gitlab ci,core java"},{"title":"QA Hybrid - Senior Engineer","company":"Iris Software","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-qa-hybrid-senior-engineer-iris-software-technologies-private-limited-noida-6-to-8-years-160926908525","source":"naukri","experience":"6-8 Yrs","skills":[116],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Experience: 6-8 Years \n\nDrive GUI testing activities to ensure usability,consistency,accessibility,and user experience quality\n\nKey Skills: api testing,mlops,business automation,it services,gui testing,logistics,financial services,healthcare"},{"title":"Automation Tester (5-10 Years)-Gurgaon/Noida","company":"Infosys","location":"Noida","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-automation-tester-5-10-years-gurgaon-noida-infosys-noida-gurugram-greater-noida-5-to-10-years-131025029534","source":"naukri","experience":"5-10 Yrs","skills":[2,6],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Hiring for Selenium Automation tester with experience range 5 years & above\n\nand build POCs. You will create requirement speci